          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umwinjiro wo kwambarirwako efodi uz’ uwujishe mu nyuzi z’amasufe gusa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "urwano rw’aho gucisha umutwe ruze rusaturwe muri wo hagati, kand’ urwo rwano ruze rutērwekw akandi kajishano kameze nk’umusōzo karukīkūze, rube nk’urwano rw’ikanzo y’icuma,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikanzo y’icuma ni yo bāhora bambara mu ntambara.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kugira ngo ntiruze rucike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mubuga wawo uz’ uwutērek’ udusa n’ amakomamanga dukozwe mu nyuzi z’amasufe n’iz’ amashigisha n’izisa n’agahama, dukīkūze uwo mubuga impande zose, kand’ uz’ ugende urarobekamw’ imidende y’izahabu iwukīkūze: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo midende y’izahabu iz’ irobekeranywe n’ayo makomamanga, bikīkūze umubuga w’uwo mwinjiro impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni aze yame awambara ukw agiye guhereza, kugira ngo ntapfe: kand’ ukujegera kwayo kuze kwame kwumvikana iyo yinjiye Ahēra imbere yanje n’iy’ asohotse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
