              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaze kabe mu ruhanga rwa Aroni, kandi Aroni az’ abe ari we arābgakw ibigabitanijwe mu vyera, ivyo Abisirayeli bazogenda batirimuka mu mashikanwa yabo yera bazotanga yose; kaze kame kaba mu ruhanga rwiwe na ntaryo, kugira ngo jewe Uhoraho mbone kwākīra amashikanwa yabo.",
          "type": "text",
