        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ya kanzo uz’ uyijishe mu buryo bg’insobane mu nyuzi zera derere nziza; uz’ ujishe n’ igitambara co kuzingīra mu mutwe mu nyuzi zera derere nziza, bo n’umukanda, abahinga bavyo bawujererengekw amabara.",
          "type": "text",
