          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’abana ba Aroni na bo uz’ ubajishire amakanzo, ubajishire n’imikanda n’udukofero, bibe ivyo kubatēra icubahiro no kubashariza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo myambaro yose uz’ uyambike Aroni mukurwawe, bo n’abana biwe, ubasukekw amavuta, ubashikirize iryo bango, ubarobanure, kugira ngo bankorere igikorwa c’ubuherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ubajishire amabutura mu nyuzi zera derere, bayambare ngo bapfuke ubgambure bgabo; ave mu rukenyerero ashike mu bibero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yambare Aroni n’ abana biwe, uko bagiye kwinjira mw ihema ry’ibonaniro, cank’ uko bagiye kwegera igicaniro ngo bakorere Ahēra; kugira ngo ntibagībgeko n’ibigabitanyo, bagapfa: ico kize kimubere icagezwe c’intahava, bo n’uruvyaro rwiwe uko ruzogenda rukurikirana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.43"
            ]
          }
        }
